[StringTable.podmoga]
Прибыло подкрепление
[NewSubmission.Objectives]
Take the German defensive position by storm and entrench itself there.
According to the testimony of the prisoners, the flanks of the position are covered by minefields.
[NewSubmission.Description]
In early April 1945, from the bridgeheads on the Oder River, Soviet troops were preparing to storm Berlin. On April 11, 1945, G. Zhukov signed a combat order to the commanders of all combined arms and 16th air armies to carry out reconnaissance in force.
In the zone of the 1st Belorussian Front, 32 reconnaissance detachments were formed, consisting of rifle battalions, penal companies and sappers, reinforced with SU-76 and ISU-152 batteries. The actions of the detachments were supported by artillery and mortar regiments.
For 2 days, reconnaissance detachments fought successfully with enemy troops, occupied the first line of trenches of the German defense and entrenched themselves there. They opened the entire German defense system, the location of its firing points, artillery positions.
[NewSubmission.Success]
Victory
[NewSubmission.Failed]
Defeat
